1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,640
[片头音乐响起]
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:05,080
克拉克森：
今晚的《Top Gear》，
CLARKSON:
On tonight's  Top Gear,

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,240
史蒂夫·库根来开开
我们的廉价车。
Steve Coogan has a go
in our Reasonably-Priced Car.

4
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:11,680
买一辆二手日产 Skyline……
Buying a used Nissan Skyline...

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,000
[偷笑]
[CHUCKLING]

6
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:17,720
……还要让世界拉力锦标赛冠军
理查德·伯恩斯，
也尝尝被人折腾的滋味。
...and we give World Rally
Champion, Richard Burns,
a taste of his own medicine.

7
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:27,120
不过首先，本月有一部
英国新片上映，
But first, there's the launch
this month of a new British film

8
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:31,440
片中一位地道的英国英雄
开着一辆地道的英国车。
in which a very British hero
drives a very British car.

9
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,480
我说的当然是
《哈利·波特》，
I am, of course,
talking about Harry Potter,

10
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:37,040
但既然这期节目我们没能及时
搞到一辆福特安格利亚（Ford Anglia），
but since we couldn't get a Ford Anglia
in time for this week's show,

11
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,240
我想不妨来看一眼
这个替代品。
I thought we could have a look
at one of these instead.

12
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,840
阿斯顿·马丁 Vanquish，
It's the Aston Martin Vanquish,

13
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:45,440
这种车正是你会想一路开去
蔚蓝海岸度假的那种尤物。
and it's the kind of car
you wanna take to the Riviera.

14
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:48,440
但这里是英国，
咱们可没有什么蔚蓝海岸。
But this is Britain,
so we don't have a Riviera.

15
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,600
所以我把它开到了怀特岛。
So I took it to the Isle of Wight instead.

16
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:53,620
♪ 彼得·萨斯特 - 《你要去向何方？》 ♪
♪ Peter Sarstedt - Where Do You Go To? ♪

17
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,440
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

18
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,100
♪ 告诉我你要去向何方，♪
♪ 我的美人？♪
♪ Tell me where do you go to, ♪
♪ my lovely? ♪

19
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:11,100
♪ 当你独自躺在床上？♪
♪ When you're alone in your bed? ♪

20
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:17,160
好了，我们到了考斯城。
这里是纯正的老派英国，
And here we are, in Cowes.
This is old school Britain,

21
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:22,520
商店里卖着厚重的粗毛衣，
小酒馆里卖着顶饱的大硬菜。
shops selling heavy jumpers,
pubs selling heavy food.

22
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,680
所以这台 Vanquish 在这儿显得格格不入。
So the Vanquish seems out of place.

23
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:29,120
它采用了全新底盘，
理论上来说非常非常轻，
It has a new type of chassis
which is, theoretically, very, very light,

24
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:32,720
车身也是出于同样的原因
全由碳纤维打造。
and the body is made
of carbon fibre for the same reason.

25
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:37,440
那你大概会脑补，这台 Vanquish
You might imagine, then, that the Vanquish

26
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,480
就像那些现代英伦新派菜，
is like modern British cuisine,

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,840
在几片芝麻菜上淋两滴浓汁。
jus drizzled on to a spot of Rocket.

28
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:45,520
但根本不是，这货骨子里就是块
结结实实的老式牛排腰子馅饼。
But no, it's a proper old
steak and kidney pie, this.

29
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,000
它居然比 DB7 还要重，
It actually weighs more than the DB7

30
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:53,400
要知道那台车可是用
角磨机和教堂长椅拼出来的。
and that's made of
angle grinders, and church pews.

31
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:57,720
不过当地人似乎一点都不介意
它超重这回事。
The locals didn't seem unduly bothered
about the excess weight, though.

32
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,800
而这正是开一辆 Vanquish 最爽的地方。
And that's the best thing
about driving a Vanquish.

33
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:05,600
哪怕它售价高达 15.8 万英镑，
依然人见人爱。
Even though it costs £158,000,
everyone loves it.

34
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:11,040
这笔钱在怀特岛能买什么样的房子？
How much house can you get
for that in the Isle of Wight?

35
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:14,240
真的假的？那咱们来瞅瞅
房产中介的橱窗。
Really? So let's have a look
at the Estate Agent's Window.

36
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:17,000
那么，花一辆 Vanquish 的钱
你能买到什么？
What have you got for the price
of Vanquish, then?

37
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:19,000
那栋房子？
- 嗯哼。
That house there?
- Mm-hmm.

38
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:22,080
独栋洋房、三间卧室、起居室——
天晓得起居室是个什么鬼东西。
Detached house, three bedrooms, lounge,
whatever one of those is.

39
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:25,480
一栋三居室的房子，
价格和这台阿斯顿差不多。
Three bedroom house
for about the same as the Aston.

40
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,800
换作是你，
是要那套房，还是要这辆车？
Would you rather have
that house or that car?

41
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:30,360
选车。[笑]
- 乖姑娘。
The car. [LAUGHS]
- Good girl.

42
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,640
绝对选车。
[笑声]
Definitely the car.
[LAUGHTER]

43
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:38,680
那可是一台6.0升、
460匹马力的V12发动机。
That's a six-litre,
460 horsepower, V12 engine.

44
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:43,440
你就算把它装在自家房子上，
零百加速照样跑进五秒。
You could attach that to your house
and still do 0 to 60 in five seconds.

45
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,040
所以要是装在车里……
So in a car...

46
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:49,060
♪ Mercury Rev - The Dark Is Rising ♪
♪ Mercury Rev - The Dark Is Rising ♪

47
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:01,080
这些弯道，噢。
Those bends. Oh.

48
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:06,040
直接把你从弯角里猛甩出来。
油门到底，轰！啪！
Just hurls you out of the corners.
Just floor it and whaff! Bang!

49
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:12,360
哇哦，这车真快，
Aw. That's a fast car,

50
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:14,480
这才是货真价实的快车。
that's a properly fast car.

51
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:18,720
动力太残暴了！
So much power!

52
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:22,360
而且还不仅是动力强劲，
还有这声浪。
It's not just the power, either.
It's the noise.

53
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:24,680
听听这个。
[引擎轰鸣]
Listen to this.
[ENGINE ROARING]

54
00:03:27,480 --> 00:03:29,880
噢，我现在大可以拽一番华丽辞藻，
Oh, I could get all flowery now

55
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:32,840
跟你们说这声音宛如电闪雷鸣，
and tell you it sounds like lightning,

56
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:36,640
但实际上，这听起来就像
汤姆·琼斯弯下腰……
but actually what it sounds like
is Tom Jones bending over

57
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:40,880
在旺兹沃思监狱的澡堂里捡肥皂。
to pick up the soap while he's in
the showers in Wandsworth nick.

58
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:43,120
[惨叫声]
[SCREAMING]

59
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,360
这动静。准备好了吗？
That noise. Ready?

60
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,400
[引擎轰鸣]
- [惨叫声]
[ENGINE ROARING]
- [SCREAMING]

61
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,680
这声音简直妙不可言，
It is a wonderful noise

62
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:57,080
而且我也超爱这车的外形。
and I love the way this car looks, too.

63
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:59,400
我喜欢它的内饰，我喜欢车头的车标。
I love the interior, I like the badge.

64
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:03,520
我喜欢詹姆斯·邦德也有一辆，
我喜欢它骨子里的英伦范儿。
I like the fact James Bond
has one. I like its Britishness.

65
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:06,520
当你开着它咆哮而过时，
你会发现自己热泪盈眶，
You find yourself welling up
as you growl along

66
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:09,240
心头涌起一股强烈的爱国自豪感。
on a wave of nationalistic pride.

67
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:12,240
《我宣誓效忠祖国》。
I vow to thee, my country.

68
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:15,260
♪ Gustav Holst -
I Vow To Thee, My Country ♪
♪ Gustav Holst -
I Vow To Thee, My Country ♪

69
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:23,000
感觉就像开着道格拉斯·巴德本人
到处兜风一样。
It feels as though I'm driving around in
Douglas Bader himself.

70
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:27,360
但就像道格拉斯·巴德一样，
这辆Vanquish也缺了样东西——
But like Douglas Bader,
the Vanquish has something missing,

71
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:29,960
换挡杆。瞧。
a gear lever. Look.

72
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:35,120
取而代之的是方向盘后面
这两个F1赛车风格的换挡拨片。
Instead, I've got these Formula One-style
paddles behind the steering wheel.

73
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:40,120
右手边升挡，
左手边降挡。
Right-hand side to change up,
left-hand side to change down.

74
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:43,640
这意味着你的双手
必须时刻握在方向盘上，
That means you have to keep
both hands on the steering wheel

75
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,000
这在F1赛车里当然没问题。
which is fine in Formula One.

76
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:49,320
毕竟开F1可没人会打电话，也不会吃东西。
（会吗？）
No one talks on the phone
in Formula One, or eats.
(They do?)

77
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,440
[引擎咆哮]
[ENGINE ROARS]

78
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,840
你来试试做个三点掉头。
You try doing a three-point turn.

79
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:01,160
瞧，小岛开到头没路了，
我不得不掉个头。
Here, look, I've ran out
of island, I've got to do one.

80
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:04,680
那么，呃，挂倒挡。
So, er, reverse.

81
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:08,920
两边拨片一起拉是空挡，按这个。
Pull both of them,
that's neutral. Push that.

82
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,680
等等，没挂上。
好了，倒挡挂上了。来吧。
Wait, no, still hasn't.
Yep, we've got reverse. Now.

83
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:15,720
走起，倒车。
Here we go, back up.

84
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:19,600
所以我得先把脚从刹车上挪开，
So I've got to get my foot off the brake,

85
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:23,080
并在咱们连人带车滚进大西洋之前，
一脚踩下油门。
and before we've rolled into the
Atlantic, I've got to hit the accelerator.

86
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:25,840
但我还不能踩太猛，
But I mustn't hit it too hard,

87
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:29,680
否则我就会以140英里的时速，
直接怼进救生艇库房里。
or I'll end up in the lifeboat hut,
doing about 140 mph.

88
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,600
所以……
So...

89
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,400
[克拉克森大笑]
[CLARKSON LAUGHING]

90
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:42,320
多棒的变速箱啊。
多天才的发明啊。
What a great gearbox.
What a wonderful invention.

91
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,360
干得真漂亮，也不知道是哪位大聪明想出来的。
Well done, whoever thought of this.

92
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:46,560
手动挡招你惹你了？
What was the matter with a manual?

93
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,440
为什么非得整这么个玩意儿？
Why do we have to have this?

94
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:51,460
♪ Doves - Sea Song ♪
♪ Doves - Sea Song ♪

95
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,920
毛病还不止这些。
There are other problems, too.

96
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,960
在城里开它顿挫得要命，
而且离合器会彻底罢工——
It judders in town,
and the clutch gives up completely

97
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:01,360
只要你敢试一次
全油门弹射起步。
if you try to do
a full-bore standing start.

98
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:05,920
这意味着Vanquish等于被绑住了一只胳膊
去跟对手死磕，
That means the Vanquish has to wade into
battle with one arm tied behind its back

99
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,680
这下可要命了。
and that's a problem.

100
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:10,080
因为瞧瞧如今正面迎战它的是谁。
Because look what's
attacking it these days.

101
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:16,280
这就是全新的法拉利575，
This is the new Ferrari 575,

102
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:19,600
眼前这台还加装了同样崭新的
运动操控套件。
fitted here with an equally new
sports handling pack.

103
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:23,440
它的身价跟阿斯顿差不多。两台都是双座，
It costs about the same
as the Aston. Both are two-seaters,

104
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:26,960
都是前置后驱的GT跑车。
both are front engine, rear-drive GT cars.

105
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,560
极速都能飙到近200英里每小时。
Both do nearly 200 miles an hour.

106
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:32,280
零到六十英里加速也都在五秒以内。
Both do 0 to 60 in under five seconds.

107
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:35,040
那么，究竟哪台更胜一筹？
So, which is the best?

108
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:36,160
[引擎轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

109
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:45,400
行吧，咱们来问问开法拉利的那位仁兄。
Well, let's talk to the man
who's driving the Ferrari.

110
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:50,320
达蒙·希尔。
Damon Hill.

111
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,920
感觉怎么样？
- 棒极了。
So, what's it like?
- It's beautiful.

112
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,000
真的？
- 真的。这机器太招人喜欢了。
Really?
- Yeah. Yeah. It's just a lovely machine.

113
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,400
它满足了你对法拉利的所有幻想。
It's everything you expect from a Ferrari.

114
00:06:57,440 --> 00:07:00,640
而且它能给你带来一丝战栗感，
你懂的，就是一点点心惊肉跳。
And it gives you that slight frisson,
you know, a slight nervousness.

115
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,800
甚至有些吓人。
- 就像心里直打鼓。
Scary even.
- It's like butterflies.

116
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,960
克拉克森：真那么吓人？
- 确实。
CLARKSON: Is it scary?
- Yeah.

117
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,280
我是说，你得对它心怀敬畏，这可是跃马。
I mean, you have to pay it
some respect, it's a prancing horse.

118
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,160
你懂的，在车里你其实根本没法彻底放松。
You know, you don't actually
feel completely comfortable in the car.

119
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:12,000
你开得很享受，
但与此同时
You're enjoying driving it,
but at the same time

120
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:14,720
你又时刻警惕着，
生怕开着它稍一走神。
you're very wary of
losing concentration on it.

121
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:18,440
这样吧，
现在你开那台，我开这台。
Well, I tell you what,
you drive that now, I'll drive this.

122
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,640
行。
Okay.

123
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,760
终点见，看看咱俩各自怎么说。
Meet up at the end, see what we think.

124
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,640
还有，呃，要是我闪大灯的话，听着……
- 听到。
And, erm, if I flash, okay...
- Yeah.

125
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,760
意思是我想超车。
你就乖乖靠边，
It means I want to come by.
If you just pull over,

126
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:30,000
赶紧把路给老子让出来，懂吗？
- 行啊，没问题。
just get it out of the way, all right?
- Right. Okay.

127
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,720
你真觉得
会有这种好事发生吗？
And you really think
that is going to happen, do you?

128
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,080
我要是不让呢？
What if I don't?

129
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:36,100
♪ Propellerheads - SpyBreak! ♪
♪ Propellerheads - SpyBreak! ♪

130
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:59,120
这台车用了跟那辆阿斯顿·马丁一样蠢的变速箱。
This has the same stupid gearbox
as the Aston Martin.

131
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:02,160
但跟阿斯顿不同的是，
你完全可以不选它。
But unlike the Aston,
you don't have to have it.

132
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:06,760
你能给自己省下整整八千英镑，
八千镑啊！换来一台正儿八经的手动挡。
You can save yourself £8,000,
£8,000... and have a proper manual.

133
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:14,520
其实挺难用像什么“酷毙了”、
“极其极其震撼”之类的词去夸它的，
It's a little difficult to use words like
awesome and very, very, very impressive

134
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:19,120
毕竟你早就开惯了F1赛车。
when you are used to Formula One cars.

135
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,840
因为开过F1之后，世间万物都
显得慢吞吞的，
Because after that everything else is
a little bit sluggish,

136
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:24,480
但就其本身而言，这绝对是
一台极度震撼的利器。
but for what it is, this is
a very, very impressive piece.

137
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,520
最妙的是，你开着它既能
