151
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:26,200
我记忆中还从没坐过哪台公路车，
I don't think I can remember
ever having been in a road car

152
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,520
能把我的脑袋这么狠狠往后拽。
where my head's been thrown back.

153
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,440
真的假的？
- 真的，挂进二挡，
Really?
- You know, in second gear,

154
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,640
它就是这么把你的脑袋往靠背上砸。
it just is doing that with your head.

155
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,960
我是说，这加速真的猛得离谱。
I mean that has got
some serious acceleration on it.

156
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,840
首先，它有515匹马力。
- 没错。
First, it has got 515 horse power.
- Yeah.

157
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:39,400
但是……
克拉克森：而阿斯顿才区区460匹。
But...
CLARKSON: And the Aston has only got 460.

158
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:41,080
希尔：对，而且阿斯顿还要重得多。
HILL: Yeah, and the Aston's a lot heavier.

159
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,440
而谋杀加速性能的头号元凶就是车重。
So one thing that kills
acceleration is weight.

160
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:46,440
不过话说回来，
这台Vanquish在某些方面确实……
The thing is, though,
there are certain aspects of the Vanquish

161
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:50,000
我也真希望在法拉利上能有。
我太吃阿斯顿这颜值了。
that I'd quite like to see
on the Ferrari. I love the way it looks.

162
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:52,400
希尔：还有这声浪。
- 还有这咆哮声。
HILL: And the sound.
- And the noise.

163
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:55,840
老实说，当我坐回法拉利里时，
